        "icon": "modules/dxcufgbs-player-bastions/assets/codex/icons/guests.webp",
        "description": "<p>Visitors who stay a while: a renowned figure, someone seeking sanctuary, now and then a friendly monster or a sellsword.</p><p>Guests arrive through the Bastion's events. Some pay for their stay, some leave a letter of recommendation, and some help defend the walls.</p>"
