        "icon": "modules/dxcufgbs-player-bastions/assets/codex/icons/visitors.webp",
        "description": "<p>The steady traffic of a Bastion on a road: pilgrims, adventurers with a rumor, would-be recruits, the lord's tax collector, an envoy, now and then a spy.</p><p>A visitor may arrive each turn. Most bring news, coin or work; a few bring trouble. A Guest Wing makes paying visitors pay more.</p>"
